<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Waban started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Waban started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities analyst Annie C. Erner said she initiated coverage of Waban Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $31.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Waban is presently one of the most undervalued retail stocks around,&quot; Erner said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 5/8 at 22-3/8.</p>
</text>
